            <ArticleTitle>[Respiratory allergies].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>38-41</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A respiratory allergy corresponds to an inflammation of the airways linked to an immunological reaction of an allergic origin. Asthma is a common manifestation of such an allergy. A global approach involving the patient, and taking into account the allergen and the environment determines the effectiveness of the care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
